<div class="card mb-3">
    <h6 class="card-header d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center text-primary">
        <span><i class="mdi mdi-information-outline me-2"></i> Tips for using the receipt filters effectively</span>
        <button class="btn btn-light btn-sm" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseTips" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseTips">
            <i class="mdi mdi-chevron-down"></i>
        </button>
    </h6>
    <div id="collapseTips" class="collapse">
        <div class="card-body">
            <ul>
                <li><i class="mdi mdi-check-circle-outline text-success me-2"></i> <strong>Filter by branch:</strong> Narrow down receipts using branch code or name.</li>
                <li><i class="mdi mdi-calendar-check-outline text-primary me-2"></i> <strong>Date range:</strong> Select start and end dates to limit results.</li>
                <li><i class="mdi mdi-account-outline text-success me-2"></i> <strong>Member reference:</strong> Use the unique member reference for precise search.</li>
                <li><i class="mdi mdi-receipt-outline text-primary me-2"></i> <strong>Transaction reference:</strong> Find receipts by internal or external transaction numbers.</li>
                <li><i class="mdi mdi-file-export-outline text-success me-2"></i> <strong>Export:</strong> Download filtered results to Excel.</li>
                <li><i class="mdi mdi-reload text-info me-2"></i> <strong>Refresh often:</strong> To ensure the latest data is displayed.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>